  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AgriPath 2021-2025 f4p</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">500 million smallholder farmers need to increase their agriculture productivity, income and climate resilience. There is a lack of scientifically validated evidence on the effectiveness and cost efficiency of digital agriculture services. AgriPath aims to bring sustainable agriculture[1] to scale by identifying, evaluating, and promoting promising pathways for digitally supported agricultural advisory services. [1] The Consortium will embrace current concepts of climate resilient agriculture, climate smart agriculture, sustainable land management and agro-ecology.</narrative>
  </description>
